Description: Use Debian's package manager for application updates
 Official Debian packages must receive updates from configured Debian archives.
 Disable the automatic GitHub release check and its manual GUI control in this
 build. This also avoids an unsolicited network request during application
 startup. The standalone upstream build retains its verified updater.
